senses.gloss:
(1) ALBIZZIA LEBBEK BENTH. (AFM 1, p. 19-25; Avk: पीतशिरीष; Bpn,
p. 518; Chopra; Dgv, nr. 132; Dutt; DWH 1, p. 561-563; Gul; HB;
HK; IRM 1, p. 43; Kav; KB 2, p. 936-939; Na 1, nr. 187; Nadk. 1,
nr. 91: पीतशिरीष; PA 1, 3, p. 1-20; V 10, p. 10; Vśs; Watt CP, p. 45)
= MIMOSA SIRISSA ROXB. (AFM 1, p. 19; Dutt; HK; Roxb., p. 417;
Vśs) = ACACIA SIRISSA BUCH.-HAM. (HK; MW; PW; Wise) = A.
LEBBECK WILLD. (Vśs) = A. SPECIOSA WILLD. (AFM 1, p. 19; Avk;
Nadk. 1, nr. 17);
(2) ALBIZZIA ODORATISSIMA BENTH. (Bpn, p. 518: कालशिरीष; DWH
1, p. 561-563; KB 2, p. 939-940; PA 1, 3, p. 16-20; V 10, p. 12: पीत-
शिरीष) = MIMOSA ODORATISSIMA LINN. F. [= M. ODORATISSIMA ROXB.]
(PA 1, 3, p. 16-20) = ACACIA ODORATISSIMA WILLD.;
[]
(3) ALBIZZIA AMARA BOIVIN (Avk and Chopra: कृष्णशिरीष; DWH 1,
p. 561-563; KB 2, p. 941-942 and Nadk. 1, nr. 89: कृष्णशिरीष; PA 1,
3, p. 1) = MIMOSA AMARA ROXB. (KB 2, p. 941-942);
(4) ALBIZZIA PROCERA BENTH. (Avk and Bpn, p. 518: श्वेतशिरीष;
PA 1, 3, p. 1) = MIMOSA PROCERA ROXB.;
(5) ALBIZZIA MARGINATA MERRILL (PA 1, 3, p. 1-10) = MIMOSA
MARGINATA LINDL.;
(6) A. STIPULATA BOIV. (AFM 1, p. 19-25; PA 1, 3, p. 1-10) = A.
MARGINATA BUCH.-HAM. EX WALL.;
PA regards 5) and 6) as synonyms;
(7) A. JULIBRISSIN DURAZZ. (Avk: रक्तशिरीष) = MIMOSA KALKORA
ROXB. (Avk).
